config COMPOSITE_EAT
	bool "Composite EAT"
	select BMC_COMPOSITE_EAT_SDK
	default n
	help
	  Enable Composite EAT (Entity Attestation Token) generation. The iRoT
	  acts as the Lead Attester: it collects local evidence from Caliptra,
	  builds the signed main token with the BMC Composite EAT SDK, and
	  serves it over MCTP VDM-PCI. Disabling this drops the token builder,
	  the evidence and attestation providers, and the VDM-PCI message type.
